# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale ru
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as день [12:00, 18:00).
# Surface: the instrumental adverb "днём"/"днем" ("in the afternoon, by day"),
# the form these deictic phrases use ("сегодня днём", "завтра днём"). Both the
# ё and its e-spelling are listed.
# Source: Wiktionary, "днём" (adverb, instrumental of день)
# https://ru.wiktionary.org/wiki/днём
днём
днем
